=1790","https://youtu.be/sTtFUy7IoJI?t=218","https://youtu.be/n4KkK-OJjqA?t=1022","stats"]},{"field":"gp","text":"Four calf strains in 12 months is a real pattern of recurring soft-tissue injury, so I cut Yahoo's 69 to 65.","sources":["https://youtu.be/uI6umXsE7Vk?t=1125","https://youtu.be/hviT4hzYNME?t=1298"]},{"field":"games_out","text":"Out for the preseason with the calf. Experts expect him to miss the start of the season. No timeline is given, so I estimate about 4 games.","sources":["https://youtu.be/hviT4hzYNME?t=1298","https://youtu.be/6DnRWahYrFA?t=1269"]},{"field":"late_games_out","text":"One game, because the team was cautious with injured players last season and his calf keeps coming back.","sources":["https://youtu.be/ahNxsoU8Hx4?t=2219"]}]}],"base_sources":["espn","fanscout","fantasypros","fantrax","own-stat","yahoo"]}